    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a3/Melod%C3%ADa_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230831213323\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melodía Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a3/Melod%C3%ADa_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230831213323\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"927\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Melodía Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melod%C3%ADa_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>神圣竖琴大师</b>\n</p><p>作为宫廷乐师，她奉国王之命周游世界寻找传说中的竖琴。\n\n</p><p>一位老魔术师朋友教她魔法，她用这魔法为竖琴附上魔力。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Melodia_Master_of_the_Sacred_Harp_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260204010247\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melodia Master of the Sacred Harp S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Melodia_Master_of_the_Sacred_Harp_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260204010247\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1000\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Melodia Master of the Sacred Harp S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melodia_Master_of_the_Sacred_Harp_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/Melodia_SHM_Relaxation_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260204005511\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=